    "text": "Let a variable line passing through the centre of the circle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>16</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, meet the positive co-ordinate axes at the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo> </mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo> </mo><mi>B</mi></math>. Then the minimum value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>B</mi></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi></math> is the origin, is equal to"
